 and soap residue collect beyond the trap. In a case like this, the first step is to check whether the blockage is limited to the kitchen run or whether other fixtures are affected. Once the line is opened, the team can clear the build-up carefully, test the flow and explain what should be kept out of the sink to reduce repeat blockages.</p>","text_color":"#000000","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Open Sans","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"_background_background":"classic","_background_color":"#FFFFFF","_padding":{"unit":"rem","top":"1.6","right":"1.4","bottom":"1.6","left":"1.4","isLinked":false},"_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"8","bottom":"8","left":"8","isLinked":true},"_box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":10,"blur":28,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"},"_element_width":"initial","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"%","size":48,"sizes":[]},"_element_custom_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"_title":"Blocked Drain Local Story - Kitchen Drain Backing Up Near Heather Park, George","css_classes":"barry-field barry-copy service-local-story","_css_classes":"barry-field barry-copy service-local-story"},"elements":[]},{"id":"bdstory07","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<h3>Outside Gully Overflow Around Diaz Beach, Mossel Bay</h3><p>Coastal homes and holiday properties around Diaz Beach and nearby Mossel Bay areas often deal with sand, garden debris and heavy usage during busy periods. When an outside gully overflows, the problem may be in the branch line or further down the drain. H2O Plumbers would check the affected gully, look for signs of surcharge, clear the obstruction where accessible and confirm whether the flow returns before the area is left safe and tidy.</p>","text_color":"#000000","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Open Sans","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"_background_backgrou